# Pairs with Converges. The log purges past what the receiver acknowledged,
# so the shipper can never deliver the next write and the link never catches
# up. Deadlock checking is off so the stuck state is judged as a liveness
# failure rather than reported as a deadlock.
MODULE: ConvergesPurgeIgnoresFloor
TARGET: Converges
CLASS: Temporal
SUMMARY: the purge ignores the acknowledged floor, so shipping stalls behind the trim
PERTURBS: Purge
DEADLOCK: off

--- FIND
    /\ trim < Floor
--- REPLACE
    \* MUTATION: the purge is bounded only by the head.
    /\ trim < head
--- END